  "add_paragraph": [
    "Min-jun turns the lab's raw output — months of sound, temperature, flux and imagery — into data somebody else can use. The ==bio-acoustics== work is his: classifying a season of recordings into the species that made them.",
    "He built the pipeline that publishes the lab's sensor telemetry as a FAIR-compliant open dataset, and maintains the tools that let a field team hand over a season's data in an afternoon.",
    "He is happiest when a model is small, documented and reproducible, and least happy when a sensor's clock has drifted."
  ],
